## Security and operational work

Before deploying this application:

- authenticate and authorize webhook callers;
- verify signatures for integrated delivery channels;
- restrict CORS origins and request sizes;
- replace the in-process background task with durable processing when needed;
- avoid logging message content or secrets in sensitive environments;
- add response delivery, persistence, retries, and idempotency controls; and
- add automated tests for the selected providers and infrastructure.
